            "paragraph": "Figure 1. Schematic diagram of the proposed methodology using decadal mean annual temperature projections in Northern Europe [5.5\u00b0 W, 12.5\u00b0 E, 48.5\u00b0 N, 54.5\u00b0 N] from 14 available CMIP6 models. Panels a, b, c show the results of the original HS09 methodology. Panels d, e show the regional projections and partitioned total variance after MGW is applied. Panel f shows the original HS09 fractional contributions, with global (hatched) and regional (solid) contributors split. Global contributors are identified as the difference in total variance before and after MGW is applied (panel b panel e). The remaining regional contributors are the uncertainties as computed in panel e. See main text for details.",
